  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Displaced Afghans in Pakistan, Iran, Central Asia, and Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Overall Objective of the Action is:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Afghans on the move in Afghanistan and neighbouring countries are supported in a manner that limits the negative impact of the crisis on communities and works towards the achievement of durable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Specific Objectives of this Action are to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Specific Objective 1:&lt;/u&gt; Improved access to basic services, increased economic self-reliance and protection for Afghans on the move and vulnerable Afghan populations in the region and their host communities, with a focus on women, girls and the most vulnerable;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Specific Objective 2:&lt;/u&gt; Increased resilience for Afghan returnees, IDPs and vulnerable host communities in Afghanistan through enhanced protection spaces, providing access to gender-responsive health services, education, and livelihood opportunities.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Geographical scope of the Action: Afghanistan, Pakistan, Iran and Tajikistan.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
